# Acceptance criteria (house default)

- Behavioral flows: **Given / When / Then**.
- Short checklists only for non-flow items (static fields, copy presence, NFR thresholds).
- Missing, checklist-only, ambiguous, or contradictory flow AC → file an AnalystRequest (do not invent acceptance meaning).
- QA derives cases and verifies against GWT for flows; FE/BE review and test against the same AC.
